<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12228" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cȳrus</span></b> , i, m., =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῦρος</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The founder of the Persian monarchy</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Leg.
				2, 22, 56</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Brut. 29, 112</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Div.
				1, 23, 46</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 2, 2, 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 29,
			27</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">called Cyrus Major,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lact. 4, 5, 7</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Cyrus Minor, <i>a brother of Artaxerxes Mnemon, killed
				in the battle at Cunaxa</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Div.
				1, 25, 52</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Sen. 17, 59</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Nep.
				Alcib. 9, 5</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>An architect of the time of Cicero</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Q. Fr.
				2, 2, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Att. 2, 3, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Mil. 17,
				46</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cȳrēa</span></b> ,
				ōrum, n., <i>the structures raised by him</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Att.
				4, 10, 2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>The name of a youth</i>, <i><span class="en">Hor. C.
			1</span></i>. 33, 6; 1, 17, 25.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>V.</b>
			<i>A river of Albania</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 6,
				9, 10, § 26 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mel. 3, 5,
			6</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
